menu "kiss-tnc-bridge"

    config KTB_DEBUG_COMMANDS
        bool "debug.* commands on USB serial"
        default n
        help
            Adds debug.set, debug.frame and debug.pairing_result to the
            control API, which fake the radio, phones and errors so the LED
            and gestures can be tried without them. For development builds
            only (sdkconfig.dev); release builds leave this off.

endmenu
